      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nfrom collections import Counter\n\ndef solve():\n    t = int(sys.stdin.readline())\n    for _ in range(t):\n        n, k = map(int, sys.stdin.readline().split())\n        s = sys.stdin.readline().strip()\n        freq = Counter(s)\n        odd_count = sum(1 for count in freq.values() if count % 2 == 1)\n        remaining_length = n - k\n        \n        if remaining_length == 0:\n            print(\"YES\")\n            continue\n            \n        max_odd = min(remaining_length, odd_count + (remaining_length - sum(freq.values())) % 2)\n        if odd_count <= remaining_length and remaining_length % 2 == odd_count % 2:\n            print(\"YES\")\n        else:\n            needed_pairs = (odd_count - 1) // 2 if odd_count > 0 else 0\n            if remaining_length >= odd_count and (remaining_length - odd_count) % 2 == 0:\n                print(\"YES\")\n            else:\n                max_odds_possible = min(odd_count, remaining_length)\n                if max_odds_possible <= 1 or (max_odds_possible <= remaining_length and remaining_length % 2 == max_odds_possible % 2):\n                    print(\"YES\")\n                else:\n                    print(\"NO\")\n\nsolve()\n```",
