      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef count_beautiful_integers(low, high, k):\n    def is_beautiful(num):\n        s = str(num)\n        even = sum(1 for c in s if int(c) % 2 == 0)\n        odd = len(s) - even\n        return even == odd and num % k == 0\n    \n    count = 0\n    for num in range(low, high + 1):\n        if is_beautiful(num):\n            count += 1\n    return count\n```",
