      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    n = int(data[0])\n    A = list(map(int, data[1:n+1]))\n    q = int(data[n+1])\n    \n    queries = []\n    index = n + 2\n    for _ in range(q):\n        l = int(data[index])\n        r = int(data[index + 1])\n        index += 2\n        queries.append((l, r))\n    \n    # Precompute sleep intervals\n    intervals = []\n    for i in range(1, n // 2 + 1):\n        start_sleep = A[2 * i - 1]  # A_{2i}\n        end_sleep = A[2 * i]        # A_{2i+1}\n        intervals.append((start_sleep, end_sleep))\n    \n    results = []\n    for l, r in queries:\n        total = 0\n        for s_start, s_end in intervals:\n            overlap_start = max(l, s_start)\n            overlap_end = min(r, s_end)\n            if overlap_start < overlap_end:\n                total += overlap_end - overlap_start\n        results.append(str(total))\n    \n    print('\\n'.join(results))\n\nmain()\n```",
