      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import deque\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split('\\n')\n    H, W = map(int, data[0].split())\n    grid = []\n    for i in range(1, H+1):\n        grid.append(data[i])\n    \n    N = int(data[H+1])\n    medicines = []\n    for i in range(H+2, H+2+N):\n        r, c, e = map(int, data[i].split())\n        medicines.append((r-1, c-1, e))  # Convert to 0-indexed\n    \n    # Find start and goal\n    start = None\n    goal = None\n    for i in range(H):\n        for j in range(W):\n            if grid[i][j] == 'S':\n                start = (i, j)\n            elif grid[i][j] == 'T':\n                goal = (i, j)\n    \n    # BFS with state (row, col, energy)\n    # Use memoization: dist[row][col][energy] = True if reachable\n    # Since max energy is HW (at most 40000), but we can cap energy at H*W\n    \n    max_energy = H * W + 10\n    # visited[h][w][e]: visited with e energy at (h,w)\n    visited = [[[False]*(max_energy+1) for _ in range(W)] for __ in range(H)]\n    \n    # Start at start position with 0 energy, but must use medicine immediately to move\n    # Check if there's a medicine at start\n    medicines_at_start = [e for (r, c, e) in medicines if r == start[0] and c == start[1]]\n    # If no medicine at start, impossible to move\n    if not medicines_at_start:\n        print(\"No\")\n        return\n    \n    # Initialize queue with all possible energy increases from start\n    q = deque()\n    # Initial state: start with 0 energy, then use any medicine at start\n    for e in medicines_at_start:\n        new_energy = e\n        if new_energy <= max_energy:\n            visited[start[0]][start[1]][new_energy] = True\n            q.append((start[0], start[1], new_energy))\n    \n    directions = [(0,1), (0,-1), (1,0), (-1,0)]\n    \n    while q:\n        r, c, energy = q.popleft()\n        \n        if (r, c) == goal:\n            print(\"Yes\")\n            return\n        \n        # Try moving in 4 directions\n        for dr, dc in directions:\n            nr, nc = r + dr, c + dc\n            if 0 <= nr < H and 0 <= nc < W and grid[nr][nc] != '#' and energy > 0:\n                new_energy = energy - 1\n                # After moving, check if there's a medicine here\n                meds_here = [(r2, c2, e2) for (r2, c2, e2) in medicines \n                            if r2 == nr and c2 == nc and \n                            not any(visited[nr][nc][e] for e in range(max_energy+1))]\n                \n                if new_energy >= 0:\n                    # First consider just moving without using medicine here\n                    if not visited[nr][nc][new_energy]:\n                        visited[nr][nc][new_energy] = True\n                        q.append((nr, nc, new_energy))\n                    \n                    # Then consider using any medicine here\n                    for mr, mc, me in medicines:\n                        if mr == nr and mc == nc:\n                            # Use medicine: energy becomes me\n                            if not visited[nr][nc][me] and me <= max_energy:\n                                visited[nr][nc][me] = True\n                                q.append((nr, nc, me))\n    \n    print(\"No\")\n\nsolve()\n```",
