    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    data = sys.stdin.read().splitlines()\n    X, Y, Z = map(int, data[0].split())\n    S = data[1].strip()\n    \n    n = len(S)\n    # dp[i][caps] = min time to type first i characters with caps lock state (0=off, 1=on)\n    INF = float('inf')\n    dp = [[INF, INF] for _ in range(n+1)]\n    dp[0][0] = 0  # start with caps lock off\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        c = S[i]\n        for caps in [0, 1]:\n            if dp[i][caps] == INF:\n                continue\n                \n            # Option 1: press 'a' key only (cost X)\n            if (caps == 0 and c == 'a') or (caps == 1 and c == 'A'):\n                dp[i+1][caps] = min(dp[i+1][caps], dp[i][caps] + X)\n            \n            # Option 2: press 'a' + Shift (cost Y)\n            if (caps == 0 and c == 'A') or (caps == 1 and c == 'a'):\n                dp[i+1][caps] = min(dp[i+1][caps], dp[i][caps] + Y)\n            \n            # Option 3: press Caps Lock (cost Z), toggle state\n            new_caps = 1 - caps\n            dp[i+1][new_caps] = min(dp[i+1][new_caps], dp[i][caps] + Z)\n    \n    print(min(dp[n][0], dp[n][1]))\n\nmain()\n```",
