      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    n = int(data[0])\n    q = int(data[1])\n    \n    # adjacency list to store edges\n    adj = [set() for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    \n    index = 2\n    for _ in range(q):\n        t = int(data[index]); index += 1\n        if t == 1:\n            u = int(data[index]); v = int(data[index+1]); index += 2\n            adj[u].add(v)\n            adj[v].add(u)\n        else:\n            v = int(data[index]); index += 1\n            adj[v].clear()\n            # Also remove v from others' adjacency lists\n            for neighbor in list(adj[v]):\n                if v in adj[neighbor]:\n                    adj[neighbor].remove(v)\n        \n        # Count isolated vertices (degree 0)\n        isolated_count = sum(1 for i in range(1, n + 1) if len(adj[i]) == 0)\n        print(isolated_count)\n\nmain()\n```",
