    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    N = int(input().strip())\n    \n    # Determine minimum number of friends needed: ceil(log2(N))\n    M = 1\n    while (1 << M) < N:\n        M += 1\n    \n    print(M)\n    sys.stdout.flush()\n    \n    # Create test groups based on binary representation\n    distribution = [[] for _ in range(M)]\n    \n    for bottle in range(1, N + 1):\n        for friend_idx in range(M):\n            if (bottle - 1) & (1 << friend_idx):\n                distribution[friend_idx].append(bottle)\n    \n    for i in range(M):\n        k = len(distribution[i])\n        if k > 0:\n            print(k, *distribution[i])\n        else:\n            print(0)\n        sys.stdout.flush()\n    \n    S = input().strip()\n    \n    # Reconstruct the spoiled bottle from the results\n    bottle = 0\n    for i in range(M):\n        if S[i] == '1':\n            bottle |= (1 << i)\n    \n    # Bottle index is 1-based\n    print(bottle + 1)\n    sys.stdout.flush()\n\nmain()\n```",
