      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\nimport math\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef main():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().splitlines()\n    if not data: \n        return\n    \n    n, d = map(int, data[0].split())\n    points = []\n    for i in range(1, n+1):\n        x, y = map(int, data[i].split())\n        points.append((x, y))\n    \n    infected = [False] * n\n    infected[0] = True\n    queue = deque([0])\n    \n    while queue:\n        current = queue.popleft()\n        cx, cy = points[current]\n        \n        for i in range(n):\n            if infected[i]:\n                continue\n            px, py = points[i]\n            dist = math.sqrt((cx - px)**2 + (cy - py)**2)\n            if dist <= d:\n                infected[i] = True\n                queue.append(i)\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        print(\"Yes\" if infected[i] else \"No\")\n\nmain()\n```",
