    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef shortestSubstrings(arr):\n    n = len(arr)\n    answer = [''] * n\n    all_substrings = []\n    \n    # Precompute all substrings for each string\n    for s in arr:\n        substrs = set()\n        length = len(s)\n        for i in range(length):\n            for j in range(i + 1, length + 1):\n                substrs.add(s[i:j])\n        all_substrings.append(substrs)\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        candidates = []\n        current_substrings = sorted(all_substrings[i], key=lambda x: (len(x), x))\n        \n        for substr in current_substrings:\n            found_in_others = False\n            for j in range(n):\n                if i != j and substr in all_substrings[j]:\n                    found_in_others = True\n                    break\n            if not found_in_others:\n                candidates.append(substr)\n        \n        if candidates:\n            answer[i] = min(candidates, key=lambda x: (len(x), x))\n    \n    return answer\n```",
