    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minProcessingTime(processorTime, tasks):\n    tasks.sort(reverse=True)\n    processorTime.sort()\n    result = 0\n    for i in range(len(processorTime)):\n        start_time = processorTime[i]\n        max_task_time = max(tasks[i*4:i*4+4])\n        finish_time = start_time + max_task_time\n        result = max(result, finish_time)\n    return result\n```",
