      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    N = int(data[0])\n    M = int(data[1])\n    L = list(map(int, data[2:2+N]))\n    \n    def can_fit(width):\n        lines = 1\n        current_width = 0\n        for i, l in enumerate(L):\n            if i > 0:\n                current_width += 1  # space\n            if current_width + l > width:\n                lines += 1\n                current_width = l\n                if lines > M:\n                    return False\n            else:\n                current_width += l\n        return True\n    \n    left, right = max(L), sum(L) + (N - 1)\n    while left < right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if can_fit(mid):\n            right = mid\n        else:\n            left = mid + 1\n    \n    print(left)\n\nsolve()\n```",
