      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    n = int(data[0])\n    p = list(map(int, data[1:n+1]))\n    q = int(data[n+1])\n    \n    # Create a position map: person -> their index (0-based) in the line\n    pos = {person: idx for idx, person in enumerate(p)}\n    \n    index = n + 2\n    results = []\n    for _ in range(q):\n        a = int(data[index])\n        b = int(data[index + 1])\n        index += 2\n        if pos[a] < pos[b]:\n            results.append(str(a))\n        else:\n            results.append(str(b))\n    \n    print('\\n'.join(results))\n\nmain()\n```",
