      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minChanges(s: str) -> int:\n    changes = 0\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(s):\n        count_0 = 0\n        count_1 = 0\n        # Count consecutive same characters in current block of even size (at least 2)\n        j = i\n        while j < len(s) and (j - i + 1) <= 2:\n            if s[j] == '0':\n                count_0 += 1\n            else:\n                count_1 += 1\n            j += 1\n        # For every pair, we choose the majority character to minimize changes\n        changes += min(count_0, count_1)\n        i += 2\n    return changes\n```",
