      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef longestSemiRepetitiveSubstring(s: str) -> int:\n    n = len(s)\n    max_len = 1\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        consecutive_count = 0\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if s[j] == s[j - 1]:\n                consecutive_count += 1\n            if consecutive_count > 1:\n                break\n            max_len = max(max_len, j - i + 1)\n    \n    return max_len\n```",
