    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef canMakePalindromeQueries(s, queries):\n    n = len(s)\n    half = n // 2\n    left_s = s[:half]\n    right_s = s[half:][::-1]  # reverse of second half for easy comparison with first half\n    \n    def get_freq(t):\n        freq = [0] * 26\n        for ch in t:\n            freq[ord(ch) - ord('a')] += 1\n        return freq\n\n    # Precompute prefix frequency arrays for left_s and right_s\n    prefix_left = [get_freq(left_s[:i]) for i in range(half + 1)]\n    prefix_right = [get_freq(right_s[:i]) for i in range(half + 1)]\n\n    def get_freq_range(prefix, l, r):\n        res = [0] * 26\n        for i in range(26):\n            res[i] = prefix[r + 1][i] - prefix[l][i]\n        return res\n\n    result = []\n    for a, b, c, d in queries:\n        c, d = n - d - 1, n - c - 1  # map right part indices to mirrored positions in reversed right half\n        valid = True\n        total_left_fixed = [0] * 26\n        total_right_fixed = [0] * 26\n        \n        # Check unmatched regions outside the query ranges\n        # Left side: [0, a) and (b, half)\n        if a > 0:\n            fl = get_freq_range(prefix_left, 0, a - 1)\n            fr = get_freq_range(prefix_right, 0, a - 1)\n            for i in range(26):\n                if fl[i] > fr[i]:\n                    total_left_fixed[i] += fl[i] - fr[i]\n                elif fr[i] > fl[i]:\n                    total_right_fixed[i] += fr[i] - fl[i]\n        if b < half - 1:\n            fl = get_freq_range(prefix_left, b + 1, half - 1)\n            fr = get_freq_range(prefix_right, b + 1, half - 1)\n            for i in range(26):\n                if fl[i] > fr[i]:\n                    total_left_fixed[i] += fl[i] - fr[i]\n                elif fr[i] > fl[i]:\n                    total_right_fixed[i] += fr[i] - fl[i]\n\n        # Compare required balance\n        free_left = get_freq_range(prefix_left, a, b)\n        free_right = get_freq_range(prefix_right, c, d)\n\n        for i in range(26):\n            need_from_free = total_left_fixed[i] - free_right[i]\n            if need_from_free > 0 and need_from_free > free_left[i]:\n                valid = False\n                break\n            need_from_free = total_right_fixed[i] - free_left[i]\n            if need_from_free > 0 and need_from_free > free_right[i]:\n                valid = False\n                break\n        result.append(valid)\n    return result\n```",
