      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maximumStrength(nums, k):\n    n = len(nums)\n    dp = [[[-float('inf')] * 2 for _ in range(k + 1)] for __ in range(n + 1)]\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        dp[i][0][0] = 0\n\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        for j in range(1, min(i, k) + 1):\n            sign = 1 if j % 2 == 1 else -1\n            multiplier = k - j + 1\n            # Not taking nums[i-1] in any subarray\n            dp[i][j][0] = max(dp[i-1][j][0], dp[i-1][j][1])\n            # Taking nums[i-1] in the j-th subarray\n            dp[i][j][1] = max(dp[i-1][j][1], dp[i-1][j-1][0], dp[i-1][j-1][1]) + sign * nums[i-1] * multiplier\n    \n    return max(dp[n][k][0], dp[n][k][1])\n```",
