    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport math\n\ndef find_farthest_points():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    n = int(data[0])\n    points = []\n    for i in range(n):\n        x = int(data[1 + 2*i])\n        y = int(data[1 + 2*i + 1])\n        points.append((x, y, i+1))\n    \n    results = []\n    for i in range(n):\n        max_dist = -1\n        farthest_id = float('inf')\n        for j in range(n):\n            if i != j:\n                dx = points[i][0] - points[j][0]\n                dy = points[i][1] - points[j][1]\n                dist = math.sqrt(dx*dx + dy*dy)\n                if dist > max_dist or (dist == max_dist and points[j][2] < farthest_id):\n                    max_dist = dist\n                    farthest_id = points[j][2]\n        results.append(farthest_id)\n    \n    for res in results:\n        print(res)\n\nfind_farthest_points()\n```",
