      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef min_operations_to_median(nums, k):\n    nums.sort()\n    n = len(nums)\n    median_index = (n - 1) // 2 if n % 2 == 1 else n // 2\n    operations = 0\n    \n    for i in range(n):\n        if i <= median_index:\n            if nums[i] > k:\n                operations += nums[i] - k\n                nums[i] = k\n        else:\n            if nums[i] < k:\n                operations += k - nums[i]\n                nums[i] = k\n    \n    return abs(nums[median_index] - k) + operations\n```",
