      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    data = sys.stdin.read().strip().split('\\n')\n    if not data: \n        print(\"No\")\n        return\n    \n    N, M = map(int, data[0].split())\n    products = []\n    \n    for i in range(1, N + 1):\n        parts = list(map(int, data[i].split()))\n        P = parts[0]\n        C = parts[1]\n        funcs = set(parts[2:2 + C])\n        products.append((P, funcs))\n    \n    for i in range(N):\n        for j in range(N):\n            if i == j:\n                continue\n            Pi, Fi = products[i]\n            Pj, Fj = products[j]\n            \n            # Condition 1: Pi >= Pj\n            if Pi < Pj:\n                continue\n                \n            # Condition 2: Fj contains all functions of Fi\n            if not Fi.issubset(Fj):\n                continue\n                \n            # Condition 3: Pi > Pj OR Fj has more functions than Fi\n            if Pi > Pj or len(Fj) > len(Fi):\n                print(\"Yes\")\n                return\n    \n    print(\"No\")\n\nmain()\n```",
