      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countTestedDevices(batteryPercentages):\n    tested = 0\n    n = len(batteryPercentages)\n    for i in range(n):\n        if batteryPercentages[i] > 0:\n            tested += 1\n            for j in range(i + 1, n):\n                batteryPercentages[j] = max(0, batteryPercentages[j] - 1)\n    return tested\n```",
