      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef relocateMarbles(nums, moveFrom, moveTo):\n    positions = set(nums)\n    for i in range(len(moveFrom)):\n        if moveFrom[i] in positions:\n            positions.remove(moveFrom[i])\n            positions.add(moveTo[i])\n    return sorted(list(positions))\n```",
