      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maxPalindromes(words):\n    total_chars = {}\n    for word in words:\n        for c in word:\n            total_chars[c] = total_chars.get(c, 0) + 1\n    \n    pairs = 0\n    singles = 0\n    for count in total_chars.values():\n        pairs += count // 2\n        singles += count % 2\n    \n    lengths = sorted([len(word) for word in words])\n    result = 0\n    for length in lengths:\n        needed_pairs = length // 2\n        if pairs >= needed_pairs:\n            pairs -= needed_pairs\n            if length % 2 == 1:\n                if singles > 0:\n                    singles -= 1\n                else:\n                    # Use one pair to create two singles, break one pair\n                    if pairs > 0:\n                        pairs -= 1\n                        singles += 1\n                        singles -= 1\n                    else:\n                        continue\n            result += 1\n        else:\n            break\n    return result\n```",
