      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    data = sys.stdin.read().splitlines()\n    if not data: \n        print(-1)\n        return\n    T = data[0].strip()\n    N = int(data[1])\n    \n    bags = []\n    for i in range(2, 2+N):\n        parts = data[i].split()\n        A_i = int(parts[0])\n        strings = parts[1:A_i+1]\n        bags.append(strings)\n    \n    dp = [float('inf')] * (len(T) + 1)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    \n    for i in range(N):\n        new_dp = dp[:]\n        for j in range(len(T)+1):\n            if dp[j] == float('inf'):\n                continue\n            for s in bags[i]:\n                if T[j:j+len(s)] == s:\n                    new_j = j + len(s)\n                    if new_j <= len(T):\n                        new_dp[new_j] = min(new_dp[new_j], dp[j] + 1)\n        dp = new_dp\n    \n    print(dp[len(T)] if dp[len(T)] != float('inf') else -1)\n\nmain()\n```",
