      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef is_good(nums):\n    n = max(nums)\n    expected_len = n + 1\n    if len(nums) != expected_len:\n        return False\n    \n    freq = {}\n    for num in nums:\n        freq[num] = freq.get(num, 0) + 1\n    \n    # Check if numbers 1 to n-1 appear exactly once\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        if freq.get(i, 0) != 1:\n            return False\n    \n    # Check if n appears exactly twice\n    if freq.get(n, 0) != 2:\n        return False\n    \n    return True\n```",
