    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef has_trailing_zero(nums):\n    # Count numbers divisible by 4 (last two bits '00')\n    count = sum(1 for x in nums if x % 4 == 0)\n    # If at least two such numbers exist, their OR will end with '00'\n    if count >= 2:\n        return True\n    # Else check if any pair contains at least one even number\n    evens = sum(1 for x in nums if x % 2 == 0)\n    # Two evens guarantee at least one trailing zero in OR\n    return evens >= 2\n```",
