      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    idx = 0\n    N = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    \n    people_bets = []\n    for _ in range(N):\n        c = int(data[idx])\n        idx += 1\n        bets = list(map(int, data[idx:idx + c]))\n        idx += c\n        people_bets.append((c, set(bets)))\n    \n    X = int(data[idx])\n    \n    # Find people who bet on X\n    candidates = []\n    min_bets = float('inf')\n    \n    for i in range(N):\n        c, bets = people_bets[i]\n        if X in bets:\n            if c < min_bets:\n                min_bets = c\n            candidates.append((i + 1, c))\n    \n    # Filter only those with minimum bets\n    result = [person for person, bet_count in candidates if bet_count == min_bets]\n    result.sort()\n    \n    print(len(result))\n    if result:\n        print(' '.join(map(str, result)))\n    else:\n        print()\n\nsolve()\n```",
