      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef can_sort_array(nums):\n    def count_bits(n):\n        return bin(n).count('1')\n    \n    n = len(nums)\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(i+1, n):\n            if nums[i] > nums[j]:\n                # Check if all elements between i and j can be swapped through\n                bits_i = count_bits(nums[i])\n                bits_j = count_bits(nums[j])\n                if bits_i != bits_j:\n                    return False\n                # Check intermediate elements\n                for k in range(i, j):\n                    if count_bits(nums[k]) != bits_i:\n                        return False\n    return True\n```",
