    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data: \n        return\n    H, W, K = int(data[0]), int(data[1]), int(data[2])\n    grid = []\n    for i in range(H):\n        grid.append(data[3 + i])\n    \n    INF = float('inf')\n    min_ops = INF\n    \n    # Horizontal check\n    for i in range(H):\n        for j in range(W - K + 1):\n            ops = 0\n            possible = True\n            for k in range(K):\n                c = grid[i][j + k]\n                if c == 'x':\n                    possible = False\n                    break\n                elif c == '.':\n                    ops += 1\n            if possible:\n                min_ops = min(min_ops, ops)\n    \n    # Vertical check\n    for j in range(W):\n        for i in range(H - K + 1):\n            ops = 0\n            possible = True\n            for k in range(K):\n                c = grid[i + k][j]\n                if c == 'x':\n                    possible = False\n                    break\n                elif c == '.':\n                    ops += 1\n            if possible:\n                min_ops = min(min_ops, ops)\n    \n    print(-1 if min_ops == INF else min_ops)\n\nsolve()\n```",
