      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef numberOfPowerfulInt(start: int, finish: int, limit: int, s: str) -> int:\n    def count_up_to(n):\n        sn = str(n)\n        len_s = len(s)\n        len_n = len(sn)\n        if len_s > len_n:\n            return 0\n        # DP to count valid numbers <= n with suffix s and digits <= limit\n        res = 0\n        # Count numbers with length < len_n\n        for l in range(len_s, len_n):\n            if l == len_s:\n                # Only one possibility if all digits in s are <= limit (given)\n                num = int(s)\n                if num <= n and all(int(d) <= limit for d in s):\n                    res += 1\n            else:\n                # Numbers with more digits than s but less than n's length\n                # First digit from 1 to min(limit, 9), others from 0 to limit, but last |s| digits fixed as s\n                free_digits = l - len_s\n                res += (min(limit, 9)) * (limit + 1) ** (free_digits - 1) if free_digits > 1 else min(limit, 9)\n        # Now count numbers with same length as n and <= n\n        # Extract prefix part: digits before suffix s\n        target_suffix = s\n        prefix_max = sn[:-len_s] if len_s < len_n else \"\"\n        if len(prefix_max) == 0:\n            # The number has same length as s\n            if int(s) <= n and all(int(d) <= limit for d in s):\n                return res + 1\n            else:\n                return res\n        # Otherwise, build valid prefixes\n        total = 0\n        prefix_len = len(prefix_max)\n        for i in range(prefix_len):\n            digit = int(sn[i])\n            low = 0 if i > 0 else 1\n            for d in range(low, min(digit, limit) + 1):\n                remaining = prefix_len - i - 1\n                total += (limit + 1) ** remaining if remaining > 0 else 1\n            if digit > limit:\n                break\n            # Continue building exact path\n        # Check exact match\n        candidate = prefix_max + s\n        if len(candidate) == len_n and int(candidate) <= n and all(int(d) <= limit for d in candidate):\n            total += 1\n        return res + total\n    \n    return count_up_to(finish) - count_up_to(start - 1)\n```",
