    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\nfrom collections import deque\n\ndef min_operations(x, y):\n    if x == y:\n        return 0\n    \n    visited = set()\n    queue = deque([(x, 0)])\n    visited.add(x)\n    \n    while queue:\n        curr, ops = queue.popleft()\n        \n        # Generate next states\n        next_states = []\n        if curr % 11 == 0:\n            next_states.append(curr // 11)\n        if curr % 5 == 0:\n            next_states.append(curr // 5)\n        next_states.append(curr - 1)\n        next_states.append(curr + 1)\n        \n        for nxt in next_states:\n            if nxt == y:\n                return ops + 1\n            if 0 <= nxt <= 20000 and nxt not in visited:\n                visited.add(nxt)\n                queue.append((nxt, ops + 1))\n    \n    return -1\n```",
