      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef solve():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    idx = 0\n    t = int(data[idx])\n    idx += 1\n    \n    results = []\n    \n    for _ in range(t):\n        n = int(data[idx])\n        k = int(data[idx + 1])\n        idx += 2\n        s = data[idx]\n        idx += 1\n        \n        ops = 0\n        i = 0\n        while i < n:\n            if s[i] == 'B':\n                ops += 1\n                # Use a greedy strategy: cover this 'B' and the next k-1 cells\n                i += k\n            else:\n                i += 1\n    \n        results.append(str(ops))\n    \n    print(\"\\n\".join(results))\n\nsolve()\n```",
