    "prediction": "qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-2507",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef findMissingAndRepeatedValues(grid):\n    n = len(grid)\n    total_elements = n * n\n    seen = set()\n    duplicate = -1\n    \n    for row in grid:\n        for val in row:\n            if val in seen:\n                duplicate = val\n            seen.add(val)\n    \n    expected_sum = total_elements * (total_elements + 1) // 2\n    actual_sum = sum(sum(row) for row in grid)\n    missing = expected_sum - (actual_sum - duplicate)\n    \n    return [duplicate, missing]\n```",
