      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef last_visited_integers(words):\n    nums = []\n    result = []\n    consecutive_prevs = 0\n    \n    for word in words:\n        if word == \"prev\":\n            consecutive_prevs += 1\n            k = consecutive_prevs\n            if k > len(nums):\n                result.append(-1)\n            else:\n                result.append(nums[-k])\n        else:\n            nums.append(int(word))\n            consecutive_prevs = 0\n    \n    return result\n```",
