      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    n = int(data[0])\n    A = []\n    B = []\n    X = []\n    index = 1\n    for _ in range(n - 1):\n        a, b, x = map(int, data[index:index + 3])\n        A.append(a)\n        B.append(b)\n        X.append(x - 1)  # Convert to 0-based index\n        index += 3\n    \n    # dp[i] = minimum time to reach stage i+1 (since stages are 1-indexed)\n    dp = [float('inf')] * n\n    dp[0] = 0  # Stage 1 is initially playable\n    \n    for i in range(n - 1):\n        # From stage i+1, we can go to i+2 (A[i]) or to X[i]+1 (B[i])\n        if dp[i] != float('inf'):\n            # Clear stage i+1 with A[i] to get to stage i+2\n            if dp[i + 1] > dp[i] + A[i]:\n                dp[i + 1] = dp[i] + A[i]\n            # Clear stage i+1 with B[i] to get to stage X[i]+1\n            dest = X[i]\n            if dp[dest] > dp[i] + B[i]:\n                dp[dest] = dp[i] + B[i]\n    \n    print(dp[n - 1])\n\nmain()\n```",
