      "generated_answer": "```python\nimport sys\n\ndef main():\n    import sys\n    input = sys.stdin.read\n    data = input().split()\n    \n    n = int(data[0])\n    q = int(data[1])\n    R = list(map(int, data[2:2+n]))\n    queries = list(map(int, data[2+n:2+n+q]))\n    \n    R.sort()\n    prefix_sum = [0]\n    for r in R:\n        prefix_sum.append(prefix_sum[-1] + r)\n    \n    results = []\n    for x in queries:\n        left, right = 0, n\n        while left < right:\n            mid = (left + right + 1) // 2\n            if prefix_sum[mid] <= x:\n                left = mid\n            else:\n                right = mid - 1\n        results.append(str(left))\n    \n    print('\\n'.join(results))\n\nmain()\n```",
