    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef specialPerm(nums):\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\n    n = len(nums)\n    \n    # Precompute divisibility graph\n    valid = [[False] * n for _ in range(n)]\n    for i in range(n):\n        for j in range(n):\n            if i != j:\n                valid[i][j] = (nums[i] % nums[j] == 0) or (nums[j] % nums[i] == 0)\n    \n    from functools import lru_cache\n    \n    @lru_cache(None)\n    def dp(last, mask):\n        if mask == (1 << n) - 1:\n            return 1\n        \n        count = 0\n        for i in range(n):\n            if not (mask & (1 << i)) and (last == -1 or valid[last][i]):\n                count = (count + dp(i, mask | (1 << i))) % MOD\n        return count\n    \n    return dp(-1, 0)\n```",
