      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef minOperations(s1: str, s2: str, x: int) -> int:\n    n = len(s1)\n    diff = [i for i in range(n) if s1[i] != s2[i]]\n    m = len(diff)\n    \n    if m % 2 != 0:\n        return -1\n    \n    if m == 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    dp = [float('inf')] * (m + 1)\n    dp[0] = 0\n    dp[2] = min(x, diff[1] - diff[0])\n    \n    for i in range(4, m + 1, 2):\n        dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[i-2] + min(x, diff[i-1] - diff[i-2]))\n        if i >= 4:\n            dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[i-4] + 2 * min(x, diff[i-1] - diff[i-2]) if i >= 4 else float('inf'))\n    \n    for i in range(2, m + 1, 2):\n        gap = diff[i-1] - diff[i-2]\n        dp[i] = min(dp[i], dp[i-2] + min(x, gap))\n    \n    return dp[m]\n```",
