      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef countGoodPartitions(nums):\n    MOD = 10**9 + 7\n    last = {}\n    for i, num in enumerate(nums):\n        last[num] = i\n    \n    parts = 0\n    right = -1\n    for i, num in enumerate(nums):\n        right = max(right, last[num])\n        if i == right:\n            parts += 1\n    \n    return pow(2, parts - 1, MOD)\n```",
