      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef min_operations(nums):\n    from collections import Counter\n    freq = Counter(nums)\n    ops = 0\n    for count in freq.values():\n        if count == 1:\n            return -1\n        # Use as many groups of 3 as possible\n        ops += count // 3\n        if count % 3 != 0:\n            ops += 1\n    return ops\n```",
