      "generated_answer": "```python\ndef maximumSumOfPairs(nums1, nums2, queries):\n    n = len(nums1)\n    pairs = sorted([(nums1[i], nums2[i]) for i in range(n)], key=lambda x: -x[0])\n    \n    # Monotonic stack to keep track of points with increasing nums2 and max sum\n    stack = []\n    for a, b in pairs:\n        s = a + b\n        while stack and stack[-1][1] <= b and stack[-1][2] <= s:\n            stack.pop()\n        if not stack or stack[-1][1] < b:\n            stack.append((a, b, s))\n    \n    res = []\n    for x, y in queries:\n        # Binary search for first element with a >= x\n        lo, hi = 0, len(stack)\n        while lo < hi:\n            mid = (lo + hi) // 2\n            if stack[mid][0] >= x:\n                lo = mid + 1\n            else:\n                hi = mid\n        idx = lo - 1\n        \n        ans = -1\n        while idx >= 0:\n            if stack[idx][1] >= y:\n                ans = stack[idx][2]\n                break\n            idx -= 1\n        res.append(ans)\n    \n    return res\n```",
