      "generated_answer": "We compute $ P(TP) $ using the law of total probability:  \n$ P(TP) = P(TP|D)P(D) + P(TP|\\neg D)P(\\neg D) = (0.99)(0.05) + (1 - 0.97)(0.95) = 0.0495 + 0.0285 = 0.078 $.  \n\nThus, the correct answer is:\n\n\\boxed{I}",
