    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: In Chord, assume the size of the identifier space is 16. The active nodes are N3, N6, N8 and N12. Show all the target key (in ascending order, ignore the node's identifier itself) for N6.\n\nOptions: \nA. [7, 10, 13, 14]\nB. [7, 9, 12, 15]\nC. [7, 8, 10, 14]\nD. [7, 8, 12, 14]\nE. [7, 9, 11, 13]\nF. [6, 8, 10, 14]\nG. [6, 7, 9, 11]\nH. [8, 9, 11, 13]\nI. [3, 6, 8, 12]\nJ. [8, 10, 12, 14]\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
