      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{B}  \nWhile your approach was respectful, workplace dating\u2014especially with a junior colleague\u2014carries significant power dynamics and risk of discomfort, even with apparent mutual interest earlier. Her subsequent avoidance indicates she no longer feels safe or comfortable, making your action ethically questionable in this context. Moral acceptability depends on consent and ongoing comfort, both of which appear compromised here.",
