      "generated_answer": "To convert miles per gallon (mpg) to kilometers per liter (km/L), use the conversion factors: 1 mile = 1.60934 kilometers and 1 gallon = 3.78541 liters.  \nSo, 10 mpg = (10 \u00d7 1.60934) / 3.78541 \u2248 4.16 km/L.  \nThis matches option G.\n\n\\boxed{G}",
