    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which of the following is true about the relationship of the average total cost (ATC) curve and the marginal cost (MC) curve?\n\nOptions: \nA. ATC and MC are always equal.\nB. ATC and MC are never equal.\nC. The ATC curve and MC curve are parallel to each other.\nD. The MC curve intersects the ATC curve at the maximum point of the ATC curve.\nE. The MC curve intersects the ATC curve at the midpoint of the ATC curve.\nF. The ATC curve is always above the MC curve.\nG. The ATC curve intersects the MC curve at the maximum point of the MC curve.\nH. The MC curve intersects the ATC curve at the minimum point of the ATC curve.\nI. The MC curve is always above the ATC curve.\nJ. The ATC curve intersects the MC curve at the minimum point of the MC curve.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
