      "generated_answer": "Ricardo modified Adam Smith's theory by introducing the concept of comparative advantage, which states that countries should specialize in producing goods where they have the lowest opportunity cost, even if they are not the most efficient producers overall. This differs from Smith\u2019s emphasis on absolute advantage, where the focus is on using the fewest resources. The correct answer is:\n\n\\boxed{G}",
