    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Which statement below is the least likely to follow logically from Savigny's notion of a Volksgeist?\n\nOptions: \nA. Law is the deliberate expression of a sovereign's will.\nB. Law is an integral element of the social fabric.\nC. Law is the direct outcome of a society's economic structure.\nD. Law is like language.\nE. A society's law is a reflection of its culture.\nF. Law is merely a tool for oppression by the ruling class.\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
