    "prompt": "Please solve the following mathematical problem and provide the final answer.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Let $f(x)$ be an odd function, and let $g(x)$ be an even function.  Is $f(f(g(f(g(f(x))))))$ even, odd, or neither?\n\nEnter \"odd\", \"even\", or \"neither\".\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format, where the content inside the braces is the exact mathematical expression or number. For example: \\boxed{{42}}. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
